# SYNTHETIC TEST DATA ONLY -- NOT FOUNDRY DATA, NOT FOR SIGNOFF.
# Layer names match ICS55; every electrical value below is invented.
# This fixture exercises the EMIR flow, not process accuracy or EM/IR closure.
# Metal RESISTANCE: ohms/square; metal EM: mA/um.
# Via RESISTANCE: ohms/cut; via EM: mA per reference AREA (um^2).

METAL MET1 { RESISTANCE 0.1 EM 1.0 TNOM 25 }
METAL MET2 { RESISTANCE 0.1 EM 1.0 TNOM 25 }
METAL MET3 { RESISTANCE 0.1 EM 1.0 TNOM 25 }
METAL MET4 { RESISTANCE 0.1 EM 1.0 TNOM 25 }
METAL MET5 { RESISTANCE 0.1 EM 1.0 TNOM 25 }
METAL T4M2 { RESISTANCE 0.1 EM 1.0 TNOM 25 }
METAL RDL { RESISTANCE 0.1 EM 1.0 TNOM 25 }

VIA VIA1 { RESISTANCE 1.0 EM 1.0 AREA 0.01 LOWERLAYER MET1 UPPERLAYER MET2 }
VIA VIA2 { RESISTANCE 1.0 EM 1.0 AREA 0.01 LOWERLAYER MET2 UPPERLAYER MET3 }
VIA VIA3 { RESISTANCE 1.0 EM 1.0 AREA 0.01 LOWERLAYER MET3 UPPERLAYER MET4 }
VIA VIA4 { RESISTANCE 1.0 EM 1.0 AREA 0.01 LOWERLAYER MET4 UPPERLAYER MET5 }
VIA T4V2 { RESISTANCE 1.0 EM 1.0 AREA 0.01 LOWERLAYER MET5 UPPERLAYER T4M2 }
VIA RV { RESISTANCE 1.0 EM 1.0 AREA 0.01 LOWERLAYER T4M2 UPPERLAYER RDL }
